GRAYBOX 0
# FPS-GRAYBOX-0: the oracle's witness level, the studio's default world, as it stands. Its walls and floor are the
# level file's own bytes, pinned by their sha256; the stairs are floor. Spawn A is the session's camera cell.
name witness
level oracle/levels/witness.lvl 1b84db41a5fb3a397be81842db5df587111ac11c3ce91f8c5b560ef80c40bbec
cell 2
wall 4

spawn A 28,28 90
spawn B 44,14 270

target 33,27
target 24,25
target 8,24
target 41,14

probe wall 28,29
probe wall 28,27
probe open 27,28
probe open 5,10

route east 28,28 43,26 43,16 44,14
route west 28,28 8,26 7,23
route north 28,28 5,12 4,4
